    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've talked. i've tried. nothing changes. it's just constant pressure to be what they want. honestly, i've started thinking that the only way to actually be free, to finally have control over something, is to just... leave it all behind. like, to find a way out that they can't stop. does that even make sense? just to finally be done with the performance?",
